      "description": "Thanks to the Splinterlands team, and with the support of the Arena Vanguard, I was able to design a sick card for Foundation and here is one way for you to start getting the copies you need to put him into action! This will be a Foundation only ghost card tournament with all the creator's cards available to test out. I am making it a larger group size as well so that we do not split into groups too soon, but that may mean it will be more battles than most tournaments. Got to make it a worthy grind though, right? More opportunities will continue to come and this tourney may get tweaked as we see how it plays out. Until then, enjoy playing with these cool new cards!\n\n*Disclaimer: No multi accounting, bots, or battle helpers; host reserves the right to deny prizes to suspected or confirmed violators.*",
